              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 44,
              "fill": "#90C695",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": [
                0,
                16
              ],
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "icon_font",
                  "id": "omf6j",
                  "name": "p3CalloutIcon",
                  "width": 18,
                  "height": 18,
                  "iconFontName": "book-open",
                  "iconFontFamily": "lucide",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFF"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HUT8O",
                  "name": "p3CalloutTitle",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                  "content": "合成控制法 (Synthetic Control Method)",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "11pK6",
              "name": "p3CalloutBody",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "2DoD5",
                  "name": "p3CalloutPara1",
                  "fill": "#444444",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "SCM 最早由 Abadie and Gardeazabal (2003) 提出，用来研究西班牙巴斯克地区恐怖活动的经济成本，属于案例研究范畴 (Case Study)。Athey & Imbens (2017) 认为它是过去 15 年计量方法领域最重要的创新。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uKDz5",
                  "name": "p3CalloutPara2",
                  "fill": "#444444",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "合成控制法的基本思想是：虽然无法找到巴斯克地区的最佳控制地区，但可对西班牙的若干大城市进行适当的线性组合（赋予不同的权重），以构造一个更为贴切的「合成控制地区」(Synthetic Control Region)，然后将真实的巴斯克地区与「合成的巴斯克地区」进行对比，即可得到恐袭的影响。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
